            "isApproved": true,
            "id": "masked_363eb3cb-4589-469d-9e15-587bb200a82a",
            "content": "I paid 40 dollars extra for a guided tour and the tour guide left immediately after getting to the Statue of Liberty, he said he was running late to another tour which means he was never going to give a 4 and a half hour tour, because we started the tour at 11:30 and he had another at 1:45, the tickets say that the tour is 4:30 hours. I could have just bought general admission ferries which is exactly what I got for 24 dollars instead of 64.",
            "date": "12/30/2022, 05:31:05"
        },
        {
            "content": "Our guide Lee Ann was magnificent. She made the tour come alive. Highly recommended way to learn the history. ",
            "id": "masked_f99b0e1d-93e8-4b52-91e2-f88ed630955f",
            "isApproved": true,
