        },
        {
            "epochMs": 1663642210000,
            "providerName": null,
            "user": null,
            "numericRating": null,
            "rating": true,
            "language": "en-us",
            "content": "Very, very, very informative guide. She had shortcuts and moved us through very well. I sure wish I could remember her name right now. She made us think we understood the experience the ones coming to Ellis Island shared. She made us appreciate the Statue more and all it took to get it here.",
